---
title: "withdrawExcessInvestedCapital (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_claimed: withdrawExcessInvestedCapital(reducedAllocationSig, excessAmount)
    q_check_claimed --> q_verify_sig: investorPosition[investor].hasClaimedExcess == false
    q_check_claimed --> q_revert_claimed: already claimed excess
    q_verify_sig --> q_calc_excess: reducedAllocationSig valid from legionSigner (new allocation terms)
    q_verify_sig --> q_revert_sig: invalid signature
    q_calc_excess --> q_check_excess: excess = cachedInvestAmount - newAcceptedAmount
    q_check_excess --> q_update_cached: excess > 0
    q_check_excess --> q_revert_no_excess: no excess capital
    q_update_cached --> q_transfer: cachedInvestAmount = newAcceptedAmount
    q_transfer --> q_mark_claimed: bidToken.transfer(investor, excess)
    q_mark_claimed --> q_emit: investorPosition[investor].hasClaimedExcess = true
    q_emit --> [*]: emit ExcessCapitalWithdrawn(investor, excess)
    q_revert_claimed --> [*]: revert AlreadyClaimedExcess
    q_revert_sig --> [*]: revert InvalidSignature
    q_revert_no_excess --> [*]: revert NoExcessCapital

    note right of q_calc_excess
        INV-001: signature-based (not Merkle) excess verification
        INV-002: cachedInvestAmount updated to new accepted amount
        INV-003: hasClaimedExcess monotonic false->true
    end note
